Bootstrap: docker
From: ubuntu:24.04

%labels
    Author Geoffrey Weal
    Version 1.0.0
    Description "Simple container used to demonstrate Apptainer encryption"

%runscript
    echo "Hello World!"

%help
    This is a simple container used in the encryption lesson.

    Usage:
        apptainer run --passphrase encrypted.sif

    What it does:
        Prints "Hello World!" to stdout. The point of this example is the
        encryption of the container, not what the container itself does.
